    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b8cf73eda3a457a2084066",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "夕凪的疗愈记忆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a78dd99e6bf62b62ff014a947fb894703cb15a16597bd35cccc803b52195fd5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "47",
        "920741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb450e853ccfa0d4ca0780cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全力奉上，这诚意满满的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "861c6ec909847aa880af1bc3ea7a90c48c978fafb98adc6b2624ee56a084bd69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "47",
        "920771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:856816fcfd5e11c5814910dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "永远闪耀下去",
      "source_fingerprint": "67940374e091561a011e7e819e9598b9ec157f54d61bc673e365cf9b6f7f23ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "47",
        "92111091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ab1d3e501e8f681afbf2e3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赋予精神防护",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9ca56a453be8432ec44283cc5e68e25ae5fc703939e1e236bee6d9caba8626",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:409e556be3c50eaebb7fa741",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赋予恢复精神",
      "source_fingerprint": "698cea443104d4d2921ec16c3cb742a18ad6375a431ae648cf97099d658c53c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c28d6d9ef1bddec743ce294",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "增加比赛再挑战次数",
      "source_fingerprint": "e91e174fa0065f05fa57476d99df9a8c8993c550e1e797ca7b6fdc9fafb34bac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad6ba8567f1213abc265150",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通用因子追加抽取",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded4c78f715a5b567c2886795779c82dde0ec7238b29e556087f61583445ad2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6590834f7e563e1ac71d2a0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强化所获因子",
      "source_fingerprint": "c033f8828aa541575e7cbdde593faf80a1f03a6bb58a4c84a8cb74bcc936f595",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:648bdce010abbddc41980b0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "契合度加成提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba745b6e4d8183bd9067af160405f3852f9cee671675643934cddb4105da3f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:defc81846bab2062bd9726b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "发动固有因子",
      "source_fingerprint": "82143ca93f9d0f19089d99e6d59915a0e910308faa64c20246668e91766bd566",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48758b2cc5db644591ef3efb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赋予勤勉好学",
      "source_fingerprint": "525eefeb6d9268e1c31eb1a4d64c6da43a07986f860116d3cc1f7072f29ac82d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "470",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdde4cbe54f512efdb0d8c7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得2个仅能抵御一次干劲下降的\\n状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "686817b2342777a0ee6fd0dbf9b5adfe21bf8ff3d9f95246e17aa3442c415949",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a42c7438322d22f3434eff4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得1个仅能抵御一次不良状态的\\n状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "6933f9e7855f4f30a819184e9d1dcdfd27124e3c19a199721a0fcf72a0a23a64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ced576dc7b7db2d506f06b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中可再挑战的次数增加10次",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae20bf5b3296d99437cc44c7e51265e25b8ffa4631ad782304e8c84d2a1cbe7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e96025eb99b5626cdf45f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得因子时，从获取候选中包含的未获得通用因子中\\n随机获得最多3个",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb37a690728fa2d96b1f09a7bac21dc60aee067be72f7fe453faf404c0ace602",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b32b0f47c0b0947495d3c090",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得因子时，从获得的★1・★2因子中\\n随机将最多5个强化为★3",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0044aa68a1027adde0fa39fe6b17c4486f8956c27e8fb6b357efca07aab627c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ad1c0a3a7261c061860334b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使育成赛马娘与各继承赛马娘之间的契合度加成\\n各增加10",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d35a7ba227d07789f77404d831733e1f74d1853dc22882b89fa7d5aaf0d9bbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cefee7e693af7f0d1a50d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在资深级的继承事件中，随机追加发动\\n最多1个继承赛马娘的固有因子",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e1ac3c8999e2e8c88aaced8e41937a82bcdb07ac0922cfad1846e7f2e49f265",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cfa0ad4dc43d878ccee6420",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得学习技能所需的技能Pt减少4%的\\n状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "83e0b34048d25ad2590823015ab2b47cea8ec4049c6c9f2092bd0d417566b1fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "471",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d599f64bc5d807b1a48157",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用大量当地食材熬煮的汤底，\\n味噌醇厚的滋味，营养也是满分！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f5862e666c41009e49d908dd68385dc7adc7dd1e1adad30f02807c8000fb1c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed84d59c50e377c1cfb4f514",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奶油般丝滑的豚骨浓汤和极细面是其特色。\\n再点一份加面吃到饱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f74972912be1f280e1468bd38d115e8445d359a3dca817d618c3167f191615e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:205f63300626751612419042",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "清澈汤底蕴含满满的食材鲜味，\\n朴素外观下透出高贵气质的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c6eb3424d6dcd1b65d6f47c865a318998523ed7151ed7d3a26f998ff496954",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28dcf6e80308c9ad0b138928",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海鲜高汤与猪背脂的浓汤是其特色。\\n极粗面与散发海潮香的岩海苔风味充满魅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6b5d01fcc2892fd5f64c1fcfcc1a64573fbe2af67db3d681ad29e8d70e9712",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da900a53735521ddf1f807c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "清淡好下口的酱油汤底，\\n和Q弹面条相性拔群的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e4cdc017e453f41cb7cbc2b90656929a3a139b7a009db0e9b3b5467867d524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e620ebcdd25eeecbee994f48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极粗面和浓厚酱油风味的豚骨汤底，\\n厚切猪肉和堆积如山的蔬菜极具压迫感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2c4a3e0d5d04de11a935b9ddd0ec5c87084d16c7a436737275bbc054c255b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845ad165eb7dbb9b547e5265",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "叉烧肉汁与酱油调制的\\n汤底是其特色。用作佐料的洋葱带来清爽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8c6c7a5c570600153fa0c075c6bbe85b09ff083e65dea6f4d05a1cd0f17f46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99e17b3ff2199ae5950f70e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "满载蔬菜醇香的汤底，由鲜辣肉沫\\n和韭菜点缀，充满冲击力的滋味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbea5b6f5b9cfc31060b14754c9345f111640f4d3b943f7f6a4c198e142b0a7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af7ddcf325ccee50628e758",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "酱油汤底里猪背脂的鲜甜令人上瘾！\\n再撒上满满的清脆大青葱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aac2b40e242eb940faf5387412b1938ec34d3db921400c5c656991e1e81d2c66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13224549032684dd33d01ee0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以酱油为基础炖煮多种食材制作的\\n一碗。带着微甜的汤底让人欲罢不能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9843dcc7e7928abf31894fa7fc4c9095f1bc0900779d0171af6c9e4b03562920",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d35d3fb37ad2f9d92728f21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为9月群英月赛\\nMILE<size=44>做准备吧！</size>",
      "source_fingerprint": "a62c4b9f0e8ca47080036e59fbba163536db71772cfb194f9f2aad742a262ff5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "476",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
